  {
   "name": "Public bicycle rack expansion",
   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "The commission works with municipal departments to site and install bicycle racks across Medford using stored inventory and grant awards (M03#4, M04#6). After the city secured a grant for 40 bike racks, the commission assisted with field siting and developed installation guidelines for private businesses (M06#4, M07#4). Members also sought a dedicated municipal budget line item for racks and asked the city to add bike rack requests to SeeClickFix (M05#5, M13#3, M13#4). Work continued through 2025 and 2026 to track delayed grant installations, request cost estimates from city staff, and address localized rack maintenance complaints (M10#6, M11#6, M14#4, M16#11).",
