  {
   "name": "Bluebikes station network",
   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "The commission monitors municipal and regional expansions of the Bluebikes bikeshare network across Medford (M01#5, M03#8). In late 2023, the city added new stations at West Medford Square and Logan Park (M06#7, M08#3). Regional expansion received support in late 2024 through a $21.6 million federal grant allocated through the Metropolitan Area Planning Council (M10#5). By August 2026, the city had completed the installation of its seventeenth Bluebikes station (M17#7).",
